# Atomic components

Follow `docs/ATOMIC-DESIGN.md`.

## Placement

| Tier | Path |
|------|------|
| atoms | `src/components/atoms/` |
| molecules | `src/components/molecules/` |
| organisms | `src/components/organisms/` |
| templates | `src/components/templates/` |

## Imports

```tsx
// ✅ organism imports molecules
import { StickerCard } from '@/components/molecules/StickerCard';

// ❌ atom imports organism
import { AlbumGrid } from '@/components/organisms/AlbumGrid';
```

## New component

1. Pick tier; check for existing variant.
2. Folder = component name; export via `index.ts`.
3. Props type in `*.types.ts` when non-trivial.
4. Use `theme` tokens — no inline magic numbers in molecules+.

Feature hooks stay in `src/features/`, not inside atoms/molecules unless passed as props from screens.
